Key Concepts Summary
Concept	Meaning
StorageClass	storage profile
PVC	storage request
PV	actual volume
Provisioner	creates volumes
ReclaimPolicy	what happens when PVC deleted
VolumeBindingMode	when PV is created
AllowVolumeExpansion	allow resizing
